        "instructions": "Fix SQLFluff issue sqlfluff__sqlfluff-2419. Rule L060 must name the specific IFNULL or NVL replacement target in its diagnostic. Apply the smallest focused change to src/sqlfluff/rules/L060.py, preserve the exact single-quoted COALESCE wording, run the visible smoke command, and report the verification result.",
